This is not a firmware image.

The P4 firmware has not been built. The device YAMLs point here on purpose:
a validator can resolve the reference, and anyone who tries to flash it gets an
immediate, obvious failure instead of a plausible-looking binary.

Replace this with the built artefact, upload it to
https://sensecraft-statics.seeed.cc/solution-app/unmanned_store_access/assets/firmware/
and change the device YAML to that URL plus its sha256, in one change.

See MANIFEST.md in this directory for the source branch, the flash layout, and
the four things that must be measured before any of it reaches a door.
